#cols[(3) $cases(x^2 - 2x - 3 > 0 dou, x^2 + 3x - 4 > 0 fen)$][(4) $cases(x^2 - 2x - 3 < 0 dou, x^2 + 3x - 4 < 0 ju)$]

2. 解分式不等式：

#cols[(1) $(x + 1)/((x + 2)(x - 3)) < 0 fen$][(2) $(x^2 - 2x - 3)/(x^2 + 3x - 4) > 0 ju$]

